  "initial_corrections": [
    "Initial card min widths rounded up to 1283px in a 1280px row; after floor sizing, three visible cards left two pixels unused at 836px. Whole-pixel remainder distribution fixes both without relaxing width assertions.",
    "The hero width assertion now measures the available car-page width, which excludes the native vertical scrollbar on short landscape windows.",
    "The real HTTP test initially used the generic confirmed signal for the unseeded group path. It now activates the actual Create & race button and waits for its owned automatic race start; the separate PB path asserts exact seeded standings. The first run retained 53/52 checks with one failure each; the corrected final run passes both.",
    "The integrated fixture retained a verified source while still on the format page. Personal-best presentation is now explicitly limited to the car step, preserving the original target-free group format preview. Initial 216/4 results and final 216/0 are retained.",
    "The HTTP suite retains its existing Starlette/httpx deprecation warning. Complete script count changed from1004 to1005 during concurrent work."
  ],
